stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Started: start with idempotency key
    Started --> StepRunning: persist state and step plan
    StepRunning --> StepRunning: retry policy on transient failure
    StepRunning --> Checkpointed: step succeeds, persist checkpoint
    Checkpointed --> StepRunning: advance to next step
    StepRunning --> Compensating: retries exhausted
    Compensating --> Failed: compensation chain done, publish failure event
    Checkpointed --> Succeeded: all steps done, publish success event
    Succeeded --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
